                                        "sense_id": "a8287daf-f721-3d4b-a83c-1e6195789241",
                                        "entry_id": "5bbae064-49aa-32d1-a965-8f30fcad622d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Similar in appearance or texture (especially in softness and smoothness) to silk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "befb9db1-0275-48dd-b0d7-3aeb2e9d53ee",
                                                "sense_id": "a8287daf-f721-3d4b-a83c-1e6195789241",
                                                "text": "silky hair"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69a1a700-7313-4132-b881-6fb93071d2dd",
                                                "sense_id": "a8287daf-f721-3d4b-a83c-1e6195789241",
                                                "text": "cloth with a silky lustre"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fe0800b-ba97-4a6c-b8a1-540ef4a35bc0",
                                                "sense_id": "a8287daf-f721-3d4b-a83c-1e6195789241",
                                                "text": "A portion of the Baromez does present a rude resemblance in its shape to the figure of an animal, and is covered by a soft downy substance, which may be compared to a silky fleece, of a reddish-brown colour, and which gives to it more the appearance of a dog than a lamb."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97c7227b-8c56-46be-8892-f4ac2a0dbc9c",
                                                "sense_id": "a8287daf-f721-3d4b-a83c-1e6195789241",
                                                "text": "Then I looked close at the scalp he stroked, which was of the silkiest blonde. For a moment I was sure it come from Olga’s dear head, and reckoned also he had little Gus’s fine skull-cover someplace among his filthy effects, the stinking old savage, living out his life of murder, rapine, and squalor, and I almost knifed him before I collected myself and realized the hair was honeyer than my Swedish wife’s."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57b0eb81-5ab9-424e-ac7f-ce154f722ef0",
                                                "sense_id": "a8287daf-f721-3d4b-a83c-1e6195789241",
                                                "text": "The door opened, and there stood Miss Ellerby, looking as Miss Ellerby should, unschoolmarmish and casually chic in a silky shirt, faded jeans, and running shoes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22682ddf-338b-3a7a-b201-63e33266272b",
                                        "entry_id": "5bbae064-49aa-32d1-a965-8f30fcad622d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Smooth and pleasant; seductive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7231bd58-0d4e-4e3a-933e-db248692874a",
                                                "sense_id": "22682ddf-338b-3a7a-b201-63e33266272b",
                                                "text": "a silky wine"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7544c4fb-8e01-4a2e-858f-c3fb5c72220f",
                                                "sense_id": "22682ddf-338b-3a7a-b201-63e33266272b",
                                                "text": "a silky voice"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd79c7b5-43e7-4563-9aba-5e032d2c5475",
                                                "sense_id": "22682ddf-338b-3a7a-b201-63e33266272b",
                                                "text": "silky skills"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4a84372-08ab-4703-a0c8-e043c5edbd88",
                                                "sense_id": "22682ddf-338b-3a7a-b201-63e33266272b",
                                                "text": "If you have a circular polarizer or a neutral density (grey) filter, put that in front of the lens too. This will slow down the shutter speed even further to get silkier, smoothier (that's a word!) water motion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
